# ClearClef design

Read [docs/design.md](../docs/design.md) before changing public catalog, viewer, or shared UI styling.

- Canvas `#f5f5f5`, ink pill CTAs, no pastel orbs.
- Newsreader 300 for catalog H1 and work titles only; Geist for nav, filters, group labels, body, and `type-page-h1` admin headings; Geist Mono for metadata and rights line.
- Never Newsreader on nav, wordmark, buttons, filters, or admin.
- Catalog index is a credit-grouped contents list with hairline rows and desktop preview thumbnails.
- Catalog filters auto-submit on select change (no Apply button).
- Page-1 preview SVG in a white frame. No Verovio on list pages.
- Dark mode: lamp on a stand — charcoal chrome, white notation page; never invert SVG.
